	(gr_text "FAB & IMPEDANCE NOTES (Lion Circuits SU-06L-0165-GDM140-001 6-Layer 1.65mm ENIG):nStackup: L1 F.Cu (1oz 0.035mm) / 7628 Prepreg 0.190mm (Dk=4.69) / L2 In1.Cu GND (0.5oz 0.0175mm) / GDM-140 Core 0.450mm (Dk=4.5) / L3 In2.Cu Signal (0.5oz 0.0175mm) / 7628 Prepreg 0.190mm (Dk=4.69) / L4 In3.Cu Power (0.5oz 0.0175mm) / GDM-140 Core 0.450mm (Dk=4.5) / L5 In4.Cu GND (0.5oz 0.0175mm) / 7628 Prepreg 0.190mm (Dk=4.69) / L6 B.Cu (1oz 0.035mm).nControlled Impedance (edge-coupled microstrip on L1 F.Cu ref L2 GND & L6 B.Cu ref L5 GND):n- Diff90 (90 ohm +/-10%, USB2_P/N, USB3_0_DP/DN, USB3_1_DP/DN): width = 0.230 mm, gap = 0.1524 mm.n- Diff100 (100 ohm +/-10%, HDMI0_TX0..2/CLK, MIPI0_D0..1/C): width = 0.180 mm, gap = 0.1524 mm."
